purchase_order_id.description:
purchase_order_id links this bill to the ERP purchase order it settles;
absent when the bill did not originate from a purchase order. The server
must verify the referenced order belongs to the caller's business.

focus_pin.description:
Pin this task into the caller's own Today view. Absent leaves untouched;
true pins, false unpins. Per-caller, not per-task: Today is a personal
view, so this writes flow_task_focus_pins rather than a task column.

